### Virtual Network Configuration

I created VNET-CORP-LAB with an address space of
10.20.0.0/16 to simulate a corporate network.

![Azure VNet Overview](images/03-virtual-network-overview.png)

### Network Segmentation

I divided the network into four subnets for
Management, Servers, Applications, and Databases.
Each subnet has its own Network Security Group.

![Azure Subnets](images/02-virtual-network-subnets.png)
